Abstract
All of the superparticles (like squarks, sleptons and higgsinos) are made from superstrings in superstring theory. But in my theory the superstrings create that but may also create superenergy, supertime and superspace.

Introduction
This theory is based off Theory of Everything Sytring Theory  a theory that suggests that string theory could be the theory of everything. Superenergy, superspace and supertime would be different then energy, time and space.

The theory itself
Superstrings would not only create superparticles but would also create super energy, superspace and supertime through the same way it would create particles, energy, space and time.

What this expains
Superstring theory could be the creator of more.
